virtio-gpu without a display at start (`--gpu ...,no-display=true` and no `displays`): the guest sees every
scanout disconnected until `crosvm gpu add-displays` connects one (a monitor plugged in), the virtio-gpu display
event then tells it, as a real hotplug. Without the option crosvm adds a default display, as before.

